UID:69de561a4dacf581ff88acd9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with CultureLink\, free weekly sessions to help
  you prepare for the Canadian Citizenship Test:\n•	Learn about the test
 ’s content and structure\n•	Get support and tips from CultureLink’s 
 Volunteer Mentors\n•	Practice with sample quizzes\nContact Rubeen to res
 erve your spot or for more information: rchauhan@culturelink.ca or 437-249
 -7103\nWalk-in participants welcome.
